WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.600
The agents were working. The work was getting lost.
So I built Holt.

00:05.600 --> 00:12.200
See the whole picture: overlapping edits,
duplicate work, and dependencies across workspaces.

00:12.200 --> 00:19.800
Holt v0.4.5 finds three uncommitted-only paths in auth-session.
The gate reports HOLDS UNIQUE WORK. Nothing was deleted or moved.

00:19.800 --> 00:27.400
Connect the picture to Claude Code or local Codex
through MCP, project context, and host-specific hooks.
Illustrated flow. Setup, trust, and coverage vary by host.

00:27.400 --> 00:35.000
Find overlap, check what needs keeping,
and review protection, quarantine, and recovery tools.
Local recovery is not an off-machine backup.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
I built it for my own mess. I'd like to know if it helps with yours.
Holt, a product of Contrare Research. Built solo by Raed Siddiqui.
